   Colorer - syntax parsing library
 in source codes, supports unlimited
 languages, free syntax. Scheme
 concept, regexps, virtual scheme
 mechanism, pair structures matches,
 functions/errors lists.
   HRC language - supports more than
 90 languages, partial load. Compiled
 executables for color generating
 texts, simple viewer, hrd editor,
   FAR plugin version

